WEBVTT

00:50.967 --> 00:55.221
They say the more you try
to ignore the past,

00:56.055 --> 00:58.850
the more you become trapped in it.

01:07.817 --> 01:11.071
Yeon-su doesn't have parents,
so her grandma picks her up.

01:11.654 --> 01:13.281
Why don't you have parents?

01:13.865 --> 01:15.700
Then you can't play house with us.

01:19.370 --> 01:20.914
I don't want to anyway.

01:24.209 --> 01:25.460
That's how I am.

01:26.461 --> 01:28.463
Hey, you should stop caring about her.

01:28.546 --> 01:31.549
She doesn't care about us.
She's so self-centered.

01:31.633 --> 01:35.512
She's right.
Yeon-su never treated us to anything.

01:35.595 --> 01:37.013
We always bought her stuff.

01:37.096 --> 01:40.058
But still, it wasn't like
she asked us to buy her those things.

01:40.141 --> 01:43.186
But she's shameless
for accepting them every single time.

01:43.269 --> 01:44.771
Even though time passed…

01:46.689 --> 01:48.066
I wish…

01:51.236 --> 01:53.655
I could only be poor to the point

01:54.823 --> 01:56.366
where I could handle it.

01:57.033 --> 01:58.409
…and I became an adult…

02:04.624 --> 02:10.255
I was still that same little girl
who was at that playground.

02:16.469 --> 02:18.847
That's how my life has always been.

02:32.360 --> 02:33.403
Let's…

02:36.156 --> 02:37.657
Let's break up.

02:51.671 --> 02:53.464
To avoid getting hurt…

02:53.548 --> 02:54.424
I…

02:59.262 --> 03:01.139
…I hurt the people I loved.

03:01.848 --> 03:03.433
I don't see the point

03:04.100 --> 03:06.477
in continuing this relationship anymore.

03:07.562 --> 03:09.689
I disguised my low self-esteem
with a breakup.

03:18.156 --> 03:19.449
Enjoy your food.

03:19.532 --> 03:20.909
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

03:20.992 --> 03:22.744
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

03:27.290 --> 03:30.752
I pretended like everything was fine

03:31.753 --> 03:34.923
and hung onto the hope
that I would get used to it.

03:35.006 --> 03:36.466
That was when it happened.

03:43.223 --> 03:45.141
INCOMING CALL
CHOI UNG

03:45.934 --> 03:47.143
The day

03:47.644 --> 03:49.479
that Ung doesn't remember.

03:54.150 --> 03:58.279
The day Ung called me
for the first time after our breakup.

03:58.363 --> 04:01.115
Just tell me why we have to break up.

04:01.199 --> 04:02.992
Tell me why, Yeon-su.

04:09.666 --> 04:11.918
If you don't tell me why,

04:13.753 --> 04:17.006
I'll have no choice
but to hate everything about myself.

04:20.885 --> 04:24.305
I'll come to think of myself
as someone who deserves to be abandoned.

04:48.955 --> 04:52.166
I'm going through…

04:54.002 --> 04:55.211
a rough patch right now.

04:56.754 --> 05:00.425
My family is going
through a financial crisis.

05:02.260 --> 05:04.137
I can't afford to be dating anyone.

05:05.805 --> 05:07.265
And…

05:08.933 --> 05:13.104
there's no reason for you
to share this misery I'm in.

05:15.064 --> 05:16.357
That's why.

05:22.322 --> 05:24.032
Is that it?

05:29.245 --> 05:32.957
I would rather have you tell me
that you didn't like me anymore.

05:34.834 --> 05:36.169
If that's why…

05:39.380 --> 05:41.632
you're abandoning me…

05:44.427 --> 05:45.970
that's just ridiculous.

06:11.662 --> 06:13.956
Back then, why did we break up?

06:14.582 --> 06:17.877
That's what the past does to you.

06:19.462 --> 06:21.255
The more you try to run away from it,

06:21.339 --> 06:24.967
the more it traps you in,

06:28.221 --> 06:33.601
so that you make the same mistakes again.

06:33.684 --> 06:38.773
EPISODE 14
LIFE IS BEAUTIFUL

06:43.945 --> 06:45.071
Why all of a sudden?

06:46.864 --> 06:48.366
I've always been curious.

06:50.827 --> 06:54.455
We'd repeatedly argue,
break up, and get back together.

06:54.539 --> 06:56.290
But I was always confident…

06:57.959 --> 07:01.671
that we'd never break up for good.

07:03.673 --> 07:05.174
But on that day,

07:06.259 --> 07:07.844
I was so confused.

07:08.594 --> 07:12.807
You seemed so desperate to break up.

07:16.561 --> 07:20.022
Why was it that you wanted to break up?

07:29.949 --> 07:30.825
I was

07:32.160 --> 07:33.286
very exhausted.

07:34.120 --> 07:38.040
You know how busy I was
part-timing and job hunting.

07:43.421 --> 07:45.590
What's the point in bringing up the past?

07:45.673 --> 07:47.675
Let's forget about things like that.

07:47.758 --> 07:49.635
What matters is that we're back together.

07:50.595 --> 07:51.721
Okay.

07:56.476 --> 07:59.061
It's late. I should go home.

07:59.145 --> 08:02.356
Grandma's been upset lately
because I've been coming home late.

08:02.440 --> 08:05.193
- I'll drop you off.
- It's okay. I can take a cab.

08:05.276 --> 08:07.653
You only just got home. You should rest.

08:09.280 --> 08:10.364
Yeon-su.

08:15.119 --> 08:16.287
Get home safe.

08:16.913 --> 08:17.997
Okay.

09:33.990 --> 09:35.116
You're home.

09:36.409 --> 09:40.079
What about dinner? Did you eat already?

09:43.082 --> 09:45.668
What's wrong? Did something happen?

09:48.045 --> 09:50.715
No. It's nothing.

09:56.762 --> 09:57.930
Well…

09:59.890 --> 10:02.184
That boy came by today.

10:07.231 --> 10:08.065
I know.

10:09.108 --> 10:11.152
I swear I didn't call him over.

10:11.944 --> 10:13.779
He came on his own.

10:14.989 --> 10:16.616
So what did you say to him?

10:17.325 --> 10:18.868
Did you scold him again?

10:19.577 --> 10:21.120
No, I didn't.

10:21.203 --> 10:23.956
Do you think that's all I ever do?

10:32.965 --> 10:34.967
By the way, Yeon-su.

10:35.635 --> 10:37.011
Yes?

10:37.094 --> 10:40.222
Did you break up with him back then

10:41.766 --> 10:46.062
because we were going through a hard time?

10:55.863 --> 10:56.989
What?

11:00.409 --> 11:01.494
Did you

11:02.620 --> 11:05.122
break up with him because you had to carry

11:05.706 --> 11:07.583
all the burden yourself?

11:09.502 --> 11:12.838
No, Grandma. Why would you think that?

11:15.591 --> 11:18.677
We just fought and broke up.

11:18.761 --> 11:22.264
You know I have
a nasty temper just like you.

11:28.938 --> 11:31.482
That's such a silly thought.

11:37.405 --> 11:39.323
This is where it's the warmest.

11:40.324 --> 11:44.787
Grandma,
can I sleep here with you tonight?

12:21.323 --> 12:24.160
If you have something to say,
please go ahead.

12:25.453 --> 12:26.704
Well…

12:28.080 --> 12:31.792
Yeon-su told me
not to say anything to you.

12:32.585 --> 12:35.421
I'm only saying this
because you came here on your own.

12:36.088 --> 12:37.131
Okay.

12:38.883 --> 12:41.093
You like her, don't you?

12:42.636 --> 12:45.181
I'm sure I like her
much more than you think I do.

12:46.223 --> 12:50.060
Good. Then that's all that matters.

12:51.145 --> 12:53.355
Please stay by her side.

12:54.482 --> 12:56.859
- You don't need to worry--
- What I mean is,

12:57.485 --> 13:02.323
make sure you stay by her side
for a very long time.

13:02.990 --> 13:05.201
Don't leave her anytime soon.

13:10.706 --> 13:12.708
Ever since she was little,

13:13.334 --> 13:15.753
I was the only person she could rely on.

13:17.588 --> 13:21.509
She didn't have any friends or family.

13:22.092 --> 13:26.138
Whatever it was,
she always carried the burden herself.

13:26.931 --> 13:29.808
When our family fell apart
and we had no money,

13:30.434 --> 13:33.062
that young girl strived
to make ends meet on her own.

13:39.401 --> 13:42.905
Anyway, I think she has always

13:43.906 --> 13:46.450
had feelings for you.

13:48.953 --> 13:51.539
So please don't make her feel lonely

13:51.622 --> 13:54.083
and stay by her side.

13:57.086 --> 13:59.004
Okay. Don't worry.

14:02.633 --> 14:04.718
I know

14:05.302 --> 14:08.264
that my words might put pressure on you.

14:08.347 --> 14:09.807
But I have no choice.

14:11.350 --> 14:15.479
I can't be by her side forever.

14:16.313 --> 14:18.107
That's why I'm asking for your help.

14:32.496 --> 14:33.497
Ma'am.

14:36.375 --> 14:40.337
Did something happen to your family?

14:41.255 --> 14:42.089
What?

15:19.335 --> 15:20.878
Let's see.

15:21.837 --> 15:24.506
WITH UNG

15:32.181 --> 15:35.434
Gosh, you almost gave me a heart attack.

15:35.517 --> 15:38.103
Stop shooting. You shouldn't be
filming something like this.

15:38.187 --> 15:40.606
It's been a while.
I must capture every little detail.

15:40.689 --> 15:43.525
Let's be honest.
You know you shouldn't film this.

15:43.609 --> 15:44.902
Turn that off.

15:44.985 --> 15:48.113
- Honey, what's that?
- What do you mean?

15:48.197 --> 15:49.615
Were you going to pocket that?

15:49.698 --> 15:52.868
I wasn't pocketing anything.
I was just doing some bookkeeping.

15:52.952 --> 15:55.162
I told you, no more fishing rods.

15:55.245 --> 15:57.122
- Of course.
- We have no room at home.

15:57.206 --> 15:58.874
- Exactly.
- Okay. Give me that.

15:58.958 --> 16:00.834
I wasn't going to take this.

16:00.918 --> 16:03.545
- Give that back.
- I was going to buy some ingredients.

16:04.129 --> 16:07.132
Ji-ung, let me check your camera
and see how much he pocketed.

16:07.216 --> 16:09.468
- Ji-ung, turn this off.
- Let's see. Stop.

16:09.551 --> 16:10.970
- How do you do it?
- Let's see.

16:11.053 --> 16:12.680
- Let me see.
- Ho! When are we going?

16:12.763 --> 16:14.807
I'm all set to go.

16:14.890 --> 16:17.768
- Chang-sik, come here!
- Honey! Are you going fishing again?

16:17.851 --> 16:19.311
- We need to talk!
- Unbelievable!

16:19.395 --> 16:20.771
- Hold on!
- Hey!

16:20.854 --> 16:21.939
- Come here!
- Ho!

16:22.022 --> 16:23.983
- Just come here.
- Let's go fishing.

16:24.066 --> 16:26.068
Fishing? What a lunatic.

16:28.195 --> 16:29.196
Hey.

16:29.822 --> 16:31.281
No, I was about to leave.

16:33.075 --> 16:35.452
Why does he want to see me
so early in the morning?

16:36.245 --> 16:37.705
All right. Fine.

16:41.208 --> 16:43.460
- Your rating was pretty high.
- Yes. I saw.

16:43.544 --> 16:45.129
People seem to love it.

16:45.212 --> 16:47.923
- Yes. I heard.
- Gosh, you're annoying.

16:49.049 --> 16:51.135
Hand Chae-ran over. Let me use her now.

16:52.845 --> 16:56.015
I guess your shows always flop
because you lack common sense.

16:56.098 --> 16:58.851
She's not an object.
She's not something you can use.

16:59.935 --> 17:00.894
Kim Ji-ung!

17:04.398 --> 17:05.733
Hello.

17:06.817 --> 17:08.152
What took you so long?

17:08.235 --> 17:09.903
I've been waiting for you.

17:11.071 --> 17:14.324
I only left the office
just a few hours ago.

17:14.408 --> 17:18.203
Ji-ung, aren't you
extremely grateful to me?

17:18.871 --> 17:23.417
Don't you feel like repaying me
for my kindness and respecting me?

17:23.500 --> 17:26.336
I told you this would be successful.

17:26.420 --> 17:29.798
It's been 54 weeks since we've had
ratings like this on the first episode.

17:31.425 --> 17:34.970
What's with the long face?
Did our program get shut down?

17:35.054 --> 17:36.889
Are you not happy with the results?

17:37.890 --> 17:39.141
I guess I am.

17:41.769 --> 17:43.062
What's with you?

17:43.562 --> 17:46.065
Chae-ran, what's going on with him?

17:46.732 --> 17:49.026
He hasn't slept much,
so he must be exhausted.

17:49.109 --> 17:50.611
He's protesting.

17:51.653 --> 17:53.405
Fine, then.

17:53.489 --> 17:56.742
I'll let you do that
environmental documentary next.

17:56.825 --> 17:58.702
So just bask in the glory.

17:58.786 --> 18:01.830
- I'm eating with the director today, so--
- I'm okay.

18:03.082 --> 18:04.374
Forget it, you punk.

18:04.458 --> 18:06.168
What a rude, little scumbag.

18:06.251 --> 18:08.170
He became even more annoying.

18:08.837 --> 18:11.882
By the way, what do they think?
Ung and Yeon-su I mean.

18:12.549 --> 18:13.801
I'm not sure. I didn't ask.

18:13.884 --> 18:16.512
They're going to be even more famous now.

18:16.595 --> 18:19.640
That's the power of the media.

18:19.723 --> 18:21.350
More people will recognize them.

18:21.433 --> 18:24.144
What if the other TV stations
invite them to their shows?

18:24.228 --> 18:25.562
I doubt it.

18:26.146 --> 18:27.940
When you get famous,

18:28.023 --> 18:30.818
people end up flocking to you.

18:30.901 --> 18:34.071
That's what the media does.
It attracts unnecessary attention.

18:34.154 --> 18:36.615
Tell them to ignore anyone
they've lost touch with.

18:36.698 --> 18:39.409
They're only reaching out
to ask for a favor. Understand?

18:39.493 --> 18:41.703
- Make sure they're aware of this.
- Dong-il.

18:41.787 --> 18:44.498
- Yes?
- I know you're excited about the ratings,

18:44.581 --> 18:46.250
but we're not at that level yet.

18:46.333 --> 18:48.544
- What do you mean?
- It was only the first episode.

18:48.627 --> 18:49.670
Still.

18:51.296 --> 18:52.840
When is Ms. Lee arriving?

18:52.923 --> 18:55.050
In 20 minutes. There's a traffic jam.

18:55.634 --> 18:57.970
- Let's have the meeting once she comes.
- Okay.

19:09.731 --> 19:10.858
Gosh.

19:10.941 --> 19:12.693
He's annoying but good at his job.

19:12.776 --> 19:15.237
He's so adorable that I want to bite him.

19:15.320 --> 19:17.698
Should I try that next time?
He'd have a fit.

19:24.371 --> 19:25.539
What are you looking at?

19:25.622 --> 19:28.458
What? Oh, it's nothing.

19:33.005 --> 19:34.298
Will you be working today?

19:34.381 --> 19:37.009
Of course. The exhibition
is just around the corner.

19:37.509 --> 19:39.595
I don't think
you're sleeping well these days.

19:40.179 --> 19:43.432
But I also know
that you're preparing for your exhibition.

19:44.516 --> 19:46.935
Don't worry.
I'll sleep here and there when I can.

19:47.853 --> 19:50.272
What will you do next
once the exhibition is over?

19:50.355 --> 19:51.773
Do you have any plans?

19:52.441 --> 19:54.735
Well, I didn't really think about it.

19:55.360 --> 19:56.195
I see.

19:58.322 --> 20:00.949
Maybe I'll just take a break

20:01.617 --> 20:03.619
and just pick you up to and from work.

20:08.624 --> 20:10.626
How's your new project going?

20:10.709 --> 20:12.836
Well, I guess it's going all right.

20:12.920 --> 20:14.254
Is it not fun?

20:14.796 --> 20:17.966
I just do it because it's work.

20:18.050 --> 20:19.134
I see.

20:21.845 --> 20:23.555
- Yeon-su.
- Yes?

20:23.639 --> 20:24.848
When you get off work--

20:24.932 --> 20:26.975
No way. It's Ung! See?

20:27.059 --> 20:28.644
I told you they lived around here.

20:28.727 --> 20:30.354
It's true. You're Ung and Yeon-su, right?

20:30.437 --> 20:32.981
Hey, where are your manners?
They're 29 years old.

20:33.065 --> 20:35.692
Hello. We watched your documentary.
We're fans of yours.

20:35.776 --> 20:36.985
Why are you together?

20:37.069 --> 20:39.029
Don't you dislike each other? Was I wrong?

20:39.112 --> 20:40.113
Was it all scripted?

20:40.197 --> 20:42.032
Hey, they could've grown on each other.

20:42.115 --> 20:44.409
Gosh, you look more
good-looking in person.

20:44.493 --> 20:47.037
Are you close to NJ?
I see your name when I search hers.

20:47.537 --> 20:48.664
Can we take a photo?

20:48.747 --> 20:50.707
- Well… Sure.
- Awesome!

20:56.797 --> 20:58.715
There. That's me, right?

20:59.841 --> 21:01.134
I look good.

21:01.218 --> 21:04.346
I look better from the left,
but they only shot me from the right.

21:04.429 --> 21:07.391
Gosh. Ms. Kook looks charismatic.

21:07.474 --> 21:10.227
Ung is the one who's the most surprising.

21:10.310 --> 21:13.021
- Compared to ten years ago…
- Right.

21:13.105 --> 21:15.816
You never know
what the future has in store for you.

21:15.899 --> 21:17.734
His studio was huge too.

21:17.818 --> 21:20.237
They're still bickering so much.

21:21.238 --> 21:23.740
I never knew this side of her.

21:23.824 --> 21:25.909
- Right? She's surprisingly cute.
- Yes.

21:25.993 --> 21:27.160
Starting today,

21:28.912 --> 21:31.915
you're not allowed to watch
that documentary at work.

21:31.999 --> 21:34.126
You can't talk about it either.

21:34.209 --> 21:35.585
- Yes, ma'am.
- Yes, ma'am.

21:35.669 --> 21:37.587
Ms. Kook, what's going on?

21:37.671 --> 21:40.132
Where's my interview? Was it edited out?

21:40.215 --> 21:42.426
I told you to tell them not to--

21:42.509 --> 21:44.261
We can't talk about that here.

21:44.344 --> 21:47.431
- I talked for an hour--
- We can't seem to focus on work lately.

21:47.514 --> 21:51.184
The Soen project should have been
our stepping stone to something greater.

21:51.268 --> 21:54.980
You're aware that our current project
isn't going to turn any heads, right?

21:58.025 --> 22:02.612
Right. Do you guys have plans
this evening?

22:03.447 --> 22:06.992
Of course not.
We should be working since we're so busy.

22:07.075 --> 22:09.619
That's right. I'm ready to work overtime.

22:09.703 --> 22:11.663
I came prepared
and wore comfortable pants.

22:11.747 --> 22:14.791
I'll also stay behind and assist you all.

22:14.875 --> 22:16.793
- Mr. Bang.
- What?

22:16.877 --> 22:19.212
Right. I should stay behind too.

22:19.296 --> 22:22.507
It's not that. I was thinking
about treating you to a meal

22:23.133 --> 22:25.177
if you were all free tonight.

22:26.636 --> 22:27.846
What do you say?

22:30.474 --> 22:31.349
Well…

22:31.933 --> 22:34.311
Filming at work
must have been an inconvenience.

22:34.394 --> 22:38.023
- If you're free--
- I'd love that, Ms. Kook.

22:38.106 --> 22:40.358
Does that mean you'll be joining us today?

22:40.942 --> 22:42.194
Or I could just pay and--

22:42.277 --> 22:44.321
- No.
- No. That's okay.

22:44.404 --> 22:47.699
I don't think you've ever joined us
at our get-togethers.

22:47.783 --> 22:49.785
I'd love that. What do you guys think?

22:49.868 --> 22:51.244
- I love it.
- Me too.

22:51.328 --> 22:52.621
I must be dreaming.

22:52.704 --> 22:54.498
Where should we go? What should we eat?

22:54.581 --> 22:56.875
- Ji-un, pick out something delicious.
- Okay. I'll look.

22:56.958 --> 22:59.920
Let's get ready to clock out.

23:00.003 --> 23:02.589
- Let's be quick, guys.
- Yes, sir.

23:02.672 --> 23:03.965
What should I do?

23:04.633 --> 23:06.635
- Can you find a nice chicken place?
- Chicken?

23:08.303 --> 23:09.638
What bread would you like?

23:09.721 --> 23:11.139
Anything will do.

23:11.223 --> 23:13.517
We'll both have white bread
and American cheese.

23:13.600 --> 23:14.643
Please heat it up.

23:15.811 --> 23:17.187
Any vegetables you don't like?

23:17.771 --> 23:18.730
Why do you ask?

23:18.814 --> 23:20.816
We'll have all of them in one
and the other without olives.

23:21.733 --> 23:23.693
What about the sauce?

23:23.777 --> 23:27.489
- Anything tasty will do.
- Ranch and onion. Thank you.

23:28.198 --> 23:29.324
Jeez.

23:31.159 --> 23:33.662
- Hey.
- You can pay for this.

23:33.745 --> 23:35.330
What will you do without me?

23:41.002 --> 23:44.339
You're often awake at this hour.
Did you give up on sleeping entirely?

23:44.923 --> 23:48.218
No. I sleep a bit at night
thanks to Yeon-su.

23:48.301 --> 23:50.512
That's what I've been telling you to do.

23:50.595 --> 23:52.764
But now you listen because it's Yeon-su.

23:52.848 --> 23:54.474
What a hopeless romantic you are.

23:55.892 --> 23:58.228
Ung, I'm rejecting
all interviews and magazine offers

23:58.311 --> 24:00.730
so you can focus on the exhibition.

24:00.814 --> 24:03.024
I guess people
really loved the documentary.

24:03.108 --> 24:05.193
You're even getting offers from TV shows.

24:05.735 --> 24:06.903
Reject them all.

24:06.987 --> 24:09.364
Some of them want both you and Yeon-su.

24:09.447 --> 24:11.116
I should reject them too, right?

24:11.199 --> 24:12.701
I'll ask her first.

24:13.827 --> 24:15.912
This is exactly why I refuse to date.

24:15.996 --> 24:19.207
You don't get to decide on anything.
It only ties you down.

24:19.916 --> 24:22.627
Are you planning to do
everything she tells you from now on?

24:29.426 --> 24:30.760
Hey.

24:30.844 --> 24:34.472
- What kind of person do I come off as?
- What?

24:35.056 --> 24:39.186
Do I look lost and aimless?

24:39.269 --> 24:41.229
You've always been like that though.

24:46.359 --> 24:47.819
Was that a serious question?

24:48.820 --> 24:51.615
- Did Yeon-su nag you?
- No.

24:52.282 --> 24:55.076
Maybe she's just given up on me.

24:55.744 --> 24:57.245
What do you mean?

24:57.329 --> 25:00.123
I can't help but admit
that I'm quite irresponsible.

25:00.916 --> 25:02.500
I'm not all that reliable either.

25:02.584 --> 25:05.170
Maybe that's why she doesn't
rely on me when things get tough.

25:08.632 --> 25:12.052
Ung. It was five years ago
that you swore to be successful.

25:12.135 --> 25:13.595
And look how far you've come.

25:13.678 --> 25:15.388
Can you call that irresponsible?

25:15.472 --> 25:17.724
No. Plus, I have high standards.

25:17.807 --> 25:20.101
Can't you see
that I'm devoting my twenties to you?

25:21.144 --> 25:22.354
Don't be ridiculous.

25:23.647 --> 25:25.565
You didn't have to flatter me like that.

25:25.649 --> 25:27.651
I don't know why you're thinking that,

25:27.734 --> 25:31.404
but it's true you're weird
and awfully childish.

25:31.488 --> 25:32.697
What now?

25:32.781 --> 25:35.075
But you're a pretty cool guy.
At least in my eyes.

25:35.951 --> 25:37.869
It doesn't matter what you think.

25:37.953 --> 25:39.955
And can't you see how much
I'm relying on you?

25:40.038 --> 25:43.041
You give me a monthly salary,
pay for my food, and my house.

25:54.970 --> 25:58.265
Hey, Ji-ung.
I heard your documentary was a success.

25:58.348 --> 26:00.684
I envy you, you punk.

26:01.559 --> 26:03.603
- Would you like a cup?
- That'd be great.

26:06.690 --> 26:08.233
How's your project going?

26:08.733 --> 26:12.570
Well, I think it's going well,
but I'm not sure either.

26:12.654 --> 26:14.197
What's wrong?

26:14.281 --> 26:15.949
Do you know NJ?

26:17.534 --> 26:19.786
I must have gotten
the wrong impression of her.

26:20.453 --> 26:23.748
- Why?
- I mean, she's a bit…

26:25.500 --> 26:26.710
strange.

26:27.585 --> 26:30.005
It's the tenth anniversary of her debut,

26:30.088 --> 26:32.882
but she sounds like an aged singer
who's about to retire soon.

26:32.966 --> 26:34.426
She seems pretty out of it.

26:36.428 --> 26:38.763
I've seen many people like her.

26:39.347 --> 26:42.058
They end up causing trouble
when they're like that.

26:42.934 --> 26:45.478
- Really?
- We'll keep shooting,

26:45.562 --> 26:49.649
but I hope she won't cause
any trouble until we're done.

26:51.443 --> 26:55.113
Hey, I should get going.
I need to record a narration.

26:55.196 --> 26:58.283
Anyway, you better treat me
to a nice meal sometime soon.

26:58.366 --> 26:59.326
Okay.

26:59.409 --> 27:00.493
- Bye.
- Goodbye.

27:16.551 --> 27:19.054
"After driving down an empty road,
I arrived here."

27:19.929 --> 27:23.141
"I spend my free time
doing what I want to do."

27:24.142 --> 27:26.644
"I haven't been able to relax like this
in a long time."

27:38.031 --> 27:39.157
NJ?

27:42.243 --> 27:44.537
Oh, I'm sorry.

27:44.621 --> 27:46.748
That's fine. Let's do a retake.

27:50.960 --> 27:54.297
"Spending some alone time is great."

28:02.389 --> 28:05.392
"But whenever I go
to nice places or have delicious food,

28:06.142 --> 28:09.521
I want to share
those moments with a friend."

28:11.356 --> 28:13.108
Is there a problem?

28:15.610 --> 28:17.153
Something's wrong with the script.

28:18.113 --> 28:19.322
Which part?

28:19.906 --> 28:21.157
I don't have any friends.

28:25.286 --> 28:26.162
Sorry?

28:26.788 --> 28:29.207
Do people think about their friends
in such situations?

28:29.290 --> 28:30.625
I see.

28:31.626 --> 28:34.963
Then should we change that to "family"?

28:49.102 --> 28:50.812
We're not open yet.

28:52.605 --> 28:54.190
Please come by 5 p.m…

29:00.530 --> 29:01.698
Have you been well?

29:05.243 --> 29:06.286
My dear Sol.

29:19.507 --> 29:22.051
How dare you come here, Jin-seob?

29:23.178 --> 29:25.138
I know you're happy to see me again,

29:25.221 --> 29:27.599
- so don't pretend like you're not.
- Me?

29:28.266 --> 29:30.143
Why would I be happy to see you?

29:30.226 --> 29:31.686
I know you missed me.

29:31.770 --> 29:33.646
You must be insane.

29:41.905 --> 29:44.115
Do you think that asshole is
watching right now?

29:44.199 --> 29:45.867
Jin-seob.

29:45.950 --> 29:48.411
Are you watching? Do you see this?

29:48.495 --> 29:52.582
Look at me. A group of ten people
made a reservation today.

29:52.665 --> 29:55.668
I'm doing just fine.
I hope you're doing fine too.

29:56.669 --> 29:57.837
What about it?

30:00.089 --> 30:01.508
You're not over me either.

30:02.091 --> 30:04.719
Exactly which part
gave you that impression?

30:05.678 --> 30:07.430
I can tell by looking at your face.

30:08.014 --> 30:10.642
But I had no idea
you'd reach out to me through video.

30:13.353 --> 30:14.813
You're still so adorable.

30:15.355 --> 30:16.272
Get lost.

30:21.486 --> 30:22.862
Sol-i.

30:24.113 --> 30:25.782
You have a customer.

30:27.367 --> 30:29.536
Someone scribbled over your sign.

30:29.619 --> 30:31.162
- Do you have some acetone?
- Sure.

30:31.246 --> 30:32.121
Does he work here?

30:33.581 --> 30:35.458
No, I don't.

30:38.169 --> 30:42.131
I guess he's not just a customer
but a friend of yours.

30:44.259 --> 30:46.803
Hey. I said, get lost.

30:47.762 --> 30:48.847
I knew it.

30:51.015 --> 30:53.309
You have a way with guys, don't you?

30:53.935 --> 30:56.020
- Her new boyfriend?
- Don't be ridiculous.

30:56.104 --> 30:57.564
You have no right to--

30:57.647 --> 30:59.899
I'm her ex-boyfriend. And you?

30:59.983 --> 31:01.067
I…

31:01.150 --> 31:03.695
Hey, Kim Jin-seob. Get lost.

31:03.778 --> 31:05.405
You're kicking me out
after calling me over?

31:05.488 --> 31:08.950
Are you crazy? I never wanted to see you.

31:11.286 --> 31:12.996
Then let's talk
after you close down today.

31:13.079 --> 31:14.289
I'll be waiting nearby.

31:14.372 --> 31:17.375
Cut this nonsense and just leave.

31:17.959 --> 31:20.253
Beat it before I throw something at you.

31:26.175 --> 31:27.260
Sol.

31:28.052 --> 31:29.679
I really missed you.

31:32.348 --> 31:33.683
I'll call you later.

31:34.934 --> 31:36.102
Goodbye.

32:00.209 --> 32:01.586
Why are you here?

32:03.755 --> 32:07.300
Hey. If you keep coming here,

32:07.383 --> 32:10.136
I might really treat you
like a part-timer.

32:12.680 --> 32:14.641
Why did your ex come here?

32:16.100 --> 32:17.727
Who knows?

32:17.810 --> 32:20.313
Whatever. He has a few screws loose.

32:30.531 --> 32:33.284
- What is it?
- Acetone. Hurry up.

32:33.868 --> 32:35.745
Right. Acetone.

32:36.496 --> 32:39.165
Gosh. Where did I put it?

32:43.169 --> 32:45.088
Isn't it over there?

32:46.005 --> 32:48.466
Right. You know this place
better than I do.

32:49.592 --> 32:52.679
POTATO SOUP WITH UNG

32:54.347 --> 32:56.307
- Dad.
- My goodness.

32:56.975 --> 32:58.393
Gosh, you startled me.

32:58.977 --> 33:01.187
I heard Mom caught you
pocketing some money.

33:02.772 --> 33:04.691
Is she still upset?

33:05.274 --> 33:07.485
Do you want her
to kick you out of the house?

33:07.568 --> 33:10.613
Stop buying more fishing rods.
You already have so many at home.

33:11.322 --> 33:15.284
That's rich, coming from you
when you broke so many of them.

33:16.411 --> 33:19.205
And they all feel different.

33:19.789 --> 33:22.583
I really wanted
to catch a big fish this time around.

33:22.667 --> 33:24.252
If only I had that fishing rod…

33:25.670 --> 33:28.006
Gosh. Forget it.

33:28.089 --> 33:30.717
You always side with your mom.
That's not fair.

33:30.800 --> 33:32.719
Don't you have any money saved up?

33:33.261 --> 33:36.472
Gosh. I pity you, Mr. Choi.

33:36.556 --> 33:39.976
What are you doing?
Did you come here to tease me?

33:40.059 --> 33:41.644
Jeez.

33:43.813 --> 33:45.648
Why are you getting so close?

33:45.732 --> 33:47.942
Come on. Open your pocket.

33:48.026 --> 33:49.068
Why? Hey.

33:49.152 --> 33:50.695
What is that? Hey.

33:51.779 --> 33:52.864
Don't tell Mom.

33:52.947 --> 33:55.324
Buy that rod and keep it well hidden.

33:55.408 --> 33:57.744
Don't let her find it
and have her scold me as well.

33:58.828 --> 34:02.248
- My dear son!
- Dad, she's going to find out.

34:06.002 --> 34:08.129
But it's pretty expensive.

34:08.212 --> 34:10.506
Gosh. I know, so I gave you enough.

34:11.299 --> 34:13.176
My son…

34:15.511 --> 34:17.805
Gosh. You really didn't need to do this.

34:17.889 --> 34:19.182
I'm really fine though.

34:19.265 --> 34:21.225
- You don't have any money.
- What?

34:21.309 --> 34:24.020
Dad, your son earns quite a bit.

34:24.103 --> 34:25.563
Gosh.

34:25.646 --> 34:27.940
You stayed up for days
to earn this. How could I…

34:28.566 --> 34:31.194
You've grown up so much.

34:31.277 --> 34:32.695
Hey, get on my back.

34:32.779 --> 34:34.197
- Stop that.
- Gosh.

34:34.280 --> 34:35.782
- Gosh.
- Goodness.

34:35.865 --> 34:37.909
What? Hey, Chang-sik.

34:37.992 --> 34:40.578
Chang-sik.

34:41.496 --> 34:45.291
Ung just gave me pocket money.

34:47.043 --> 34:48.669
Yeon-ok!

34:48.753 --> 34:51.672
Hey, what are you doing? Hey!

34:52.507 --> 34:53.424
Right.

35:07.271 --> 35:08.356
Mr. Kim?

35:11.025 --> 35:12.443
It was you back there, right?

35:13.486 --> 35:16.364
Yes. Are you done recording?

35:17.198 --> 35:20.827
No, not yet. I'm waiting for them
to revise a few things,

35:20.910 --> 35:22.954
so I came to say hi.

35:26.290 --> 35:28.709
You never seem to have a proper dinner.

35:30.086 --> 35:32.797
Right. Did you have dinner yet?

35:32.880 --> 35:34.715
No, I can't eat. I'm on a diet.

35:35.383 --> 35:38.678
If you're eating alone,
should I sit with you?

35:38.761 --> 35:40.638
People who eat alone break my heart.

35:42.473 --> 35:44.767
Sure. I won't stop you.

35:44.851 --> 35:47.478
I'm a bit busy,
so I was going to eat alone anyway.

35:56.279 --> 35:58.948
What do you think about
when you're eating alone?

36:01.409 --> 36:03.578
I think about how much
rice and side dishes I have left

36:04.162 --> 36:06.622
because I can't have
one without the other.

36:07.290 --> 36:08.332
I agree.

36:09.041 --> 36:12.086
Did you hear my narration about friends?

36:13.129 --> 36:16.090
Who thinks about their friends
while they eat? You just eat.

36:18.885 --> 36:21.721
By the way,
why don't you have any friends?

36:23.598 --> 36:25.892
Because my situation doesn't allow it.

36:25.975 --> 36:28.352
I've been working since I was young,

36:28.436 --> 36:31.647
so there are things I can't have
that are normal to most people.

36:32.231 --> 36:34.984
It's not easy to befriend someone
you've met through work.

36:35.067 --> 36:37.612
But I also have no time
to meet new people.

36:37.695 --> 36:39.864
That's why I just gave up making friends.

37:03.095 --> 37:04.347
You know what?

37:05.848 --> 37:08.017
If you want to live
an ordinary life like the others,

37:08.726 --> 37:10.436
just pretend that you are.

37:13.981 --> 37:17.902
It may seem difficult,
but it's all about your state of mind.

37:18.736 --> 37:20.321
And if you keep doing that,

37:20.905 --> 37:22.698
you don't even have to pretend anymore.

37:25.076 --> 37:26.953
We can't just blame our surroundings.

37:27.453 --> 37:30.164
After all,
it's our life we're talking about.

37:31.040 --> 37:33.125
It's our loss to think like that.

37:33.209 --> 37:34.669
So you should give it a shot

37:35.336 --> 37:38.256
before you give up entirely.

37:39.048 --> 37:40.383
That's all.

37:49.850 --> 37:51.394
Lately…

37:51.477 --> 37:54.105
you've been comforting me unexpectedly.

37:54.605 --> 37:55.564
Really?

37:56.148 --> 37:59.360
Do you think we're in the same situation?

38:03.239 --> 38:07.368
You collect monthly rent,
while I collect a monthly check.

38:14.959 --> 38:17.044
What is Mr. Choi up to nowadays?

38:17.712 --> 38:19.297
I knew you'd ask.

38:19.880 --> 38:21.507
I'm dying to know,

38:21.590 --> 38:24.302
but I acted all tough
and said I'd never call or visit him.

38:26.095 --> 38:28.889
See? He never calls me before I do.

38:28.973 --> 38:31.475
If I stopped trying,
he wouldn't have cared.

38:34.020 --> 38:37.982
So tell me. What is he up to?

38:38.691 --> 38:40.776
I'm not sure. We haven't met in a while.

38:40.860 --> 38:42.987
Why not? Did you two fight?

38:43.988 --> 38:45.740
We're too old for that.

38:46.365 --> 38:47.700
Then what?

38:56.959 --> 39:01.047
I should get going.
Thank you for keeping me company.

39:01.630 --> 39:02.673
Goodbye then.

39:03.632 --> 39:05.009
He's just leaving?

39:05.509 --> 39:07.678
Would it have hurt to answer me?

39:13.517 --> 39:14.685
Hey, Ung.

39:15.478 --> 39:17.438
I have a company get-together today.

39:18.898 --> 39:21.275
I know. I never attend these.

39:21.942 --> 39:25.279
I felt bad for filming at work.

39:27.448 --> 39:29.408
I shouldn't have shot the documentary.

39:29.492 --> 39:31.202
This is so bothersome.

39:33.037 --> 39:35.414
- Yes, chicken.
- Chicken.

39:35.498 --> 39:36.749
- Yes.
- Thank you.

39:36.832 --> 39:40.127
Are you sure
Ms. Ji couldn't come because she was sick?

39:40.211 --> 39:42.963
Yes, she's really sick.
She loves get-togethers.

39:43.047 --> 39:45.007
She was crying on her way home.

39:45.091 --> 39:47.885
We need to take good care
of ourselves in this day and age.

39:47.968 --> 39:49.637
Well, that's too bad.

39:49.720 --> 39:52.014
- Let's still enjoy the meal, okay?
- Okay.

39:52.098 --> 39:53.682
By the way, this is unbelievable.

39:53.766 --> 39:55.267
I never knew this day would come.

39:55.351 --> 39:57.395
I didn't propose this get-together, right?

39:57.478 --> 40:01.148
Ms. Kook made
the suggestion herself, right?

40:01.232 --> 40:03.150
Dig in guys.

40:03.234 --> 40:06.570
Why are you so ecstatic
when she's the one who's buying?

40:06.654 --> 40:08.989
Ms. Kook and I are one.

40:09.073 --> 40:10.825
We're one team and one body.

40:10.908 --> 40:12.159
She represents our company.

40:12.243 --> 40:15.830
So you also knew that she's the boss.

40:15.913 --> 40:19.333
- Another round. Cheers.
- Cheers.

40:22.545 --> 40:24.964
The beer here tastes amazing.

40:26.424 --> 40:29.343
By the way,
how did get Ms. Kook to work with you?

40:29.427 --> 40:30.928
What? What do you mean?

40:31.011 --> 40:33.431
We all know how competent she is.

40:33.514 --> 40:35.391
I'm sure a lot of companies wanted her.

40:35.474 --> 40:38.102
Oh, that? I was her senior back in school.

40:38.185 --> 40:40.980
- Really? University?
- Didn't I tell you?

40:41.063 --> 40:42.523
We were in the same club.

40:42.606 --> 40:44.525
I was the chairman of the club.

40:45.818 --> 40:47.945
She was deeply moved by my leadership

40:48.028 --> 40:51.907
and my creative
and innovative way of thinking.

40:51.991 --> 40:53.742
That's why she's working with me.

40:55.619 --> 40:58.956
But how did you go to school together

40:59.039 --> 41:01.333
- if your age gap is--
- It's smaller than you think.

41:01.417 --> 41:02.585
I see.

41:02.668 --> 41:07.006
Anyway, Ms. Kook was impressive
even in university.

41:07.756 --> 41:11.802
I've never seen anyone
work as hard in life as she does.

41:12.636 --> 41:15.890
You shouldn't talk about someone
while they're away.

41:15.973 --> 41:18.184
I know. So don't go anywhere from now on.

41:18.267 --> 41:21.187
Since she's here,
let's all drink together.

41:21.979 --> 41:24.523
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

41:26.942 --> 41:28.444
Ms. Kook.

41:28.527 --> 41:31.697
I saved you your favorite piece
since you're treating us.

41:31.780 --> 41:33.073
Thank you.

41:35.284 --> 41:36.577
I'm so moved

41:36.660 --> 41:40.206
that we're finally having
our first get-together with Ms. Kook.

41:40.289 --> 41:42.458
Promise me that you won't go home tonight.

41:42.541 --> 41:43.876
Promise me.

41:43.959 --> 41:47.129
I can see that you're happy,
but we should still go home.

41:47.213 --> 41:50.257
- Have a drink.
- Since Ms. Kook is here as well,

41:50.341 --> 41:52.551
everyone seems more excited than usual.

41:52.635 --> 41:55.971
It's true. I love it.
We should do this more.

41:56.055 --> 41:57.556
- Yes.
- I'd like to make a toast.

41:57.640 --> 41:58.724
- Sure.
- Okay.

41:58.807 --> 41:59.892
This is youth--

41:59.975 --> 42:01.894
That's enough.
Our youngest member can make a toast.

42:01.977 --> 42:04.021
Sure. Don't walk! Run!

42:09.818 --> 42:11.904
- Gosh, that's refreshing.
- It's really tasty.

42:11.987 --> 42:12.988
Have some of this.

42:13.072 --> 42:15.366
It's okay. Like I said before,
our university…

42:26.210 --> 42:27.753
Are you waiting for someone?

42:28.295 --> 42:30.464
Me? For who? No way.

42:30.548 --> 42:31.840
I think you were.

42:31.924 --> 42:34.301
You must have been waiting for your ex.

42:34.385 --> 42:36.929
Me? You're wrong.

42:43.644 --> 42:45.354
As you saw earlier,

42:45.437 --> 42:47.690
he came here
because he couldn't get over me.

42:47.773 --> 42:48.732
But not me.

42:49.608 --> 42:52.319
I do admit that guys
find it difficult to get over me.

42:52.987 --> 42:55.364
That's why they all have a tough time.

42:55.948 --> 42:57.324
But that's not my fault.

42:57.908 --> 42:59.034
I never asked.

42:59.118 --> 43:02.496
But frankly, it does bother me

43:03.330 --> 43:05.374
that he said he'd wait.

43:05.457 --> 43:07.876
I have no intention
of getting back together with him,

43:07.960 --> 43:10.921
but I'm sure he's suffering inside.

43:11.714 --> 43:14.592
So I was going to comfort him
and send him home if he came.

43:15.217 --> 43:16.135
I didn't ask.

43:17.720 --> 43:19.179
Darn it.

43:19.763 --> 43:21.682
Right. I'm glad you're here.

43:21.765 --> 43:24.977
I have to give something
to the shop next door, so stay here.

43:25.644 --> 43:27.521
Why? I need to go.

43:27.605 --> 43:28.772
Wait. It won't take long.

43:28.856 --> 43:30.608
- You better hurry.
- Okay.

43:31.275 --> 43:32.276
Thanks.

43:35.029 --> 43:36.822
From blind date to an ex-boyfriend…

43:36.905 --> 43:40.117
She should focus on her job.
Why are there so many guys around her?

43:40.826 --> 43:44.079
Gosh, she didn't empty
the trash again. Gosh.

43:44.163 --> 43:46.665
She's such a handful.

43:47.249 --> 43:49.668
Why does everyone around me

43:50.544 --> 43:53.297
always need my help at all times?

43:53.380 --> 43:55.841
LEEZAKAYA

43:57.426 --> 43:58.469
Gosh.

44:12.232 --> 44:15.319
I'm telling you. I think I can borrow
at least five million won.

44:15.402 --> 44:16.945
Business seems to be doing well.

44:18.364 --> 44:19.990
I can get the money right away.

44:20.574 --> 44:24.036
It's Sol-i. She's never said no to me.

44:24.119 --> 44:27.956
When I saw her earlier,
I could tell that she was swayed.

44:28.582 --> 44:31.418
If I coax her just right,
she'll give in to me.

44:32.086 --> 44:34.672
She may look nonchalant on the outside,

44:35.756 --> 44:37.508
but she can be quite pitiful.

44:43.389 --> 44:44.264
Hold on.

44:49.436 --> 44:51.021
We met earlier.

44:51.105 --> 44:53.023
- Excuse me.
- Yes?

44:54.692 --> 44:56.151
Who told you that?

44:57.361 --> 44:58.570
What do you mean?

45:04.910 --> 45:06.036
About Sol-i.

45:07.454 --> 45:10.332
Who said her business was doing well?

45:11.458 --> 45:12.626
I'm late.

45:13.293 --> 45:14.461
I feel bad.

45:15.546 --> 45:17.464
I should feed Eun-ho before he leaves.

45:20.467 --> 45:21.677
So…

45:23.262 --> 45:24.721
What is he doing?

45:24.805 --> 45:26.932
Sol-i isn't yours anymore.

45:28.851 --> 45:30.519
Is he crazy?

45:35.858 --> 45:37.151
She belongs

45:38.110 --> 45:39.903
to the bank. Understand?

45:40.821 --> 45:43.449
Is it that bad?
Did she take out a lot of loans?

45:43.532 --> 45:45.742
It's really bad.
She took out a maximum loan.

45:46.326 --> 45:49.121
I doubt she'll ever be
able to pay it back.

45:49.204 --> 45:50.497
I thought business was going well.

45:50.581 --> 45:51.915
Don't get me started.

45:52.499 --> 45:55.669
We have more shrimp than the number
of customers we had last month.

46:00.591 --> 46:01.884
I shouldn't have come here.

46:01.967 --> 46:03.510
That's right.

46:06.430 --> 46:09.558
Anyway, thank you for the tip-off.

46:12.603 --> 46:14.980
Aren't you going to wait for her?

46:15.063 --> 46:17.232
What for? It'll only break our hearts.

46:19.318 --> 46:22.154
Please take good care of my dear Sol.

46:38.378 --> 46:40.964
What took you so long?
You said you'd be quick.

46:41.048 --> 46:42.299
So?

46:43.425 --> 46:44.718
Any customers?

46:45.677 --> 46:49.264
No, as usual. It's nothing new.

46:52.017 --> 46:54.394
What? What is it?

46:56.480 --> 46:57.856
What are you doing?

46:58.899 --> 47:00.067
Nothing.

47:08.867 --> 47:11.620
Perfect timing. We just parted ways.

47:12.162 --> 47:13.580
Did you drink a lot?

47:14.915 --> 47:16.500
No, not that much.

47:16.583 --> 47:17.876
Are you going home?

47:18.377 --> 47:19.670
Yes.

47:19.753 --> 47:23.048
I wanted to pick you up,
but I knew you wouldn't like that.

47:23.715 --> 47:26.134
Me? Did I?

47:26.218 --> 47:28.762
Yes. You used to say you'd be embarrassed 

47:28.845 --> 47:31.598
if I came to pick you up
when you could've just walked home.

47:31.682 --> 47:33.183
You wanted to be independent.

47:34.685 --> 47:36.645
I can't believe
you still remember all that.

47:37.229 --> 47:40.607
Of course. I remember all sorts of things.

47:46.863 --> 47:48.323
But back then,

47:48.949 --> 47:52.619
I only said that because
I didn't want to take up your time.

47:53.745 --> 47:57.874
And you would have spent
a lot of money on cab fare.

47:59.626 --> 48:03.005
Back then, it seemed like a lot of money.

48:03.088 --> 48:04.756
It was intimidating.

48:05.340 --> 48:08.093
So you actually wanted me
to come pick you up.

48:09.177 --> 48:10.262
Yes.

48:10.345 --> 48:13.056
Okay. Then look behind you.

48:13.599 --> 48:14.683
What?

48:20.147 --> 48:23.275
From now on,
tell me these things in advance.

48:38.457 --> 48:39.916
If you don't tell me,

48:40.000 --> 48:42.252
I won't know since I'm an idiot.

48:49.343 --> 48:52.888
I still don't know why we broke up.

48:53.680 --> 48:54.765
So…

48:56.933 --> 48:59.186
promise that you'll tell me everything.

49:03.982 --> 49:05.150
I will.

49:05.901 --> 49:08.111
I'm sure she'll tell me one day.

49:09.321 --> 49:11.865
Waiting is what I do best after all.

49:11.948 --> 49:16.495
I listen to and remember
everything you tell me.

49:17.079 --> 49:18.455
So keep telling me.

49:23.460 --> 49:24.670
Okay.

49:26.588 --> 49:29.633
And once I find out why…

49:36.056 --> 49:40.602
I'll make sure to prevent it
from happening again.

49:44.773 --> 49:45.691
Let's go.

49:48.443 --> 49:51.863
That will be my only goal in life
from now on.

49:52.489 --> 49:53.824
There are so many stars.

49:54.991 --> 49:56.201
- Is It cold?
- Yes.

49:58.120 --> 50:00.872
I will spend
the rest of my life with Yeon-su.

51:20.577 --> 51:21.703
ENROLLMENT GUIDE
SCHOOL OF ARCHITECTURE

51:42.265 --> 51:44.976
PREPARING FOR STUDYING
AT A FRENCH ARCHITECTURE SCHOOL

51:48.563 --> 51:50.857
FRENCH GRADUATE SCHOOL
LYONE UNIVERSITY

52:06.039 --> 52:09.125
MEDICAL SERVICE
SPECIALTIES

52:40.115 --> 52:43.702
You've prepared a feast for breakfast.

52:44.327 --> 52:45.412
Goodness.

52:46.746 --> 52:49.457
What? You even grilled fish?

52:50.250 --> 52:52.210
Good grief.

52:55.589 --> 52:57.424
Gosh, that's great.

52:59.259 --> 53:01.094
- This is good.
- Grandma.

53:03.013 --> 53:04.014
Is it good?

53:06.308 --> 53:08.894
Of course it is.

53:16.484 --> 53:17.777
Have some of this.

53:17.861 --> 53:21.031
You have it. I can eat on my own.

53:30.624 --> 53:32.542
Should we go on a trip?

53:33.710 --> 53:36.838
What? A trip out of the blue?

53:36.922 --> 53:38.673
My legs will ache too much to walk.

53:39.257 --> 53:41.551
Come on. We can drive.

53:41.635 --> 53:43.428
It's getting colder now.

53:43.511 --> 53:45.931
Let's go to a hot spring and relax.

53:48.850 --> 53:52.354
I'll take a few days off from work.
Let's go sightseeing

53:52.437 --> 53:54.147
and eat lots of good food.

53:57.484 --> 53:59.110
What's gotten into you?

53:59.194 --> 54:01.988
I'll often grill your favorite fish.

54:02.906 --> 54:04.574
We'll go on many trips.

54:05.158 --> 54:07.911
And I'll buy you many pretty clothes.

54:07.994 --> 54:09.955
You can go to the community center
and brag about it.

54:16.044 --> 54:19.130
So let's live together forever.

54:27.013 --> 54:30.308
Don't go anywhere.
Stay by my side for a very long time.

54:30.976 --> 54:32.060
Okay?

54:51.204 --> 54:52.038
Yeon-su.

54:57.085 --> 54:59.254
Do you not like living with me?

55:01.047 --> 55:02.549
What are you talking about?

55:03.925 --> 55:05.093
You do, right?

55:06.094 --> 55:07.303
You like it, right?

55:09.556 --> 55:11.725
I know you like me.

55:12.892 --> 55:15.103
Everyone else may dislike me,

55:15.770 --> 55:19.107
but I know you don't. Right?

55:20.316 --> 55:23.570
Why in the world would I ever dislike you?

55:25.238 --> 55:26.406
Exactly.

55:28.742 --> 55:29.909
So…

55:31.786 --> 55:33.705
don't go anywhere.

55:34.706 --> 55:35.832
Stay by my side.

55:41.671 --> 55:42.756
I…

55:46.426 --> 55:49.262
don't ever want to be alone again.

56:14.829 --> 56:21.836
LIFE IS BEAUTIFUL

56:41.106 --> 56:48.113
EPILOGUE

57:04.629 --> 57:05.713
You're home.

57:07.966 --> 57:10.051
You're back sooner
than I expected this time.

57:11.344 --> 57:13.680
I thought it'd be at least a few months.

57:14.764 --> 57:15.932
We need to talk.

57:17.892 --> 57:19.477
I'm tired. Maybe next time.

57:20.270 --> 57:22.188
About your work…

57:24.941 --> 57:27.569
You know, filming…

57:30.029 --> 57:31.448
How did you know?

57:32.115 --> 57:35.243
I didn't know you cared about what I did.

57:39.956 --> 57:41.458
Just be as you always were.

57:41.541 --> 57:43.293
- You don't need to--
- I heard

57:44.335 --> 57:46.796
that you can film anyone.

57:48.923 --> 57:51.259
That you don't have to be special.

57:51.885 --> 57:54.179
You film ordinary people.

57:54.762 --> 57:56.347
What are you talking about?

57:57.390 --> 57:58.892
I want you to film me.

58:01.561 --> 58:02.937
Film what now?

58:04.022 --> 58:05.106
Me.

58:06.316 --> 58:07.817
Can you film me?

58:12.280 --> 58:14.115
Rest up. I'm going to bed.

58:15.783 --> 58:16.868
They say

58:17.368 --> 58:18.912
I'm going to die.

58:24.959 --> 58:26.503
I'm going to die soon.

58:31.883 --> 58:33.301
So…

58:35.762 --> 58:37.764
please film me before I do.

58:42.393 --> 58:43.645
Please do that.

58:47.190 --> 58:52.195
Subtitle translation by: Soo-ji Kim
